The .cube LUTs in assets/luts/ are original mathematical Rec.709 look
approximations generated by scripts/generate-film-look-luts.mjs. They are
not measured film/paper spectral profiles and are not derived from
spektrafilm, SpektraLab, or SpektraLens.

Look names (soft-color-neg, vivid-slide, cinema-daylight) are descriptive
only and are not affiliated with Kodak, Fujifilm, or any other trademark
holder.
